    {
      "narration": "Why build here? Coal. Ordos sits on a huge share of China's coal, and the boom made it rich, fast.",
      "camera": {
        "center": [
          109.9,
          39.7
        ],
        "span": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "narration": "So the city built big: wide avenues, a giant museum, and a library shaped like a row of books.",
